    "Please convert the provided workout exercises into a JSON format strictly following this structure:\n\n{\n  \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\" }],\n  \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\", \"colorHex\": \"string\" }],\n  \"exercises\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n      \"title\": \"string\",\n      \"subtitle\": \"string\",\n      \"details\": \"string\",\n      \"numberOfSets\": 0,\n      \"reps\": 0,\n      \"increaseLoadNextTime\": false,\n      \"isDone\": false,\n      \"weight\": 0.0,\n      \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }],\n      \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nEnsure all objects are linked by matching 'id's. Use valid UUIDs for all 'id' fields. Output ONLY valid JSON without markdown wrapping if possible.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please convert the provided workout exercises into a JSON format strictly following this structure:\n\n{\n  \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\" }],\n  \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\", \"colorHex\": \"string\" }],\n  \"exercises\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n      \"title\": \"string\",\n      \"subtitle\": \"string\",\n      \"details\": \"string\",\n      \"numberOfSets\": 0,\n      \"reps\": 0,\n      \"increaseLoadNextTime\": false,\n      \"isDone\": false,\n      \"weight\": 0.0,\n      \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }],\n      \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nEnsure all objects are linked by matching 'id's. Use valid UUIDs for all 'id' fields. Output ONLY valid JSON without markdown wrapping if possible."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Convierte los ejercicios proporcionados a JSON siguiendo estrictamente esta estructura:\n\n{\n  \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\" }],\n  \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\", \"name\": \"string\", \"colorHex\": \"string\" }],\n  \"exercises\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n      \"title\": \"string\",\n      \"subtitle\": \"string\",\n      \"details\": \"string\",\n      \"numberOfSets\": 0,\n      \"reps\": 0,\n      \"increaseLoadNextTime\": false,\n      \"isDone\": false,\n      \"weight\": 0.0,\n      \"workouts\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }],\n      \"tags\": [{ \"id\": \"uuid\" }]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nRelaciona todos los objetos mediante sus 'id'. Usa UUID válidos en todos los campos 'id'. Devuelve SOLO JSON válido, sin bloques de Markdown si es posible."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
